      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "This, patchification, \nis repeated for \nall 1024 patches per frame,\nfor the one timestep,\nall 3 camera goal images, \nall B batches. \n\nSo, there are \n1024 * 1 * 3 * B patches.\n",
